  "environment_caveats": [
    "Staging Cloudflare Pages preview returns x-robots-tag: noindex (verified via curl -sI 2026-09-28), so the Lighthouse is-crawlable audit fails on all 6 URLs and pins SEO at 69. SEO is recorded but EXCLUDED from all verdicts. Status: inconclusive - staging noindex artifact, re-audit after apex cutover.",
    "Production appears to be live already: https://tdiusa.com/ and https://www.tdiusa.com/ both return 200 serving the new Astro build with no x-robots-tag, and www.buildwithtdi.com 301s to www.tdiusa.com. The client record has apex_cutover=null, so per methodology this run still audited staging. Record apex_cutover.completed_at so the next run audits production and scores SEO.",
    "tdiusa.com (bare apex) serves 200 directly instead of 301-redirecting to www.tdiusa.com. Canonicals point at www, which mitigates duplicate-host indexing, but a host-level redirect is the correct fix. Not scored this run (off-origin).",
    "Canonicals on staging point to https://www.tdiusa.com/... (changed from https://tdiusa.com/... in the 2026-08-28 run). DataForSEO flags canonical=false because the target is off-origin from staging; expected pre-cutover and NOT counted as a defect.",
    "DataForSEO instant_pages returned has_micromarkup=false, but JSON-LD parses on every checked page (Organization, WebSite, LocalBusiness; plus FAQPage and BreadcrumbList on /services/ and /contact/), verified against served HTML. Treated as a DataForSEO false negative.",
    "Client record status is \"onboarding\", not \"active\". Audit proceeded because the scheduler's System 3 gate keys on build_status (pushed_main), consistent with the 2026-08-28 run.",
    "Lighthouse 13.4.0 agentic-browsing category recorded per URL as agentic_browsing_score, excluded from verdicts.",
    "on_page_lighthouse / on_page_instant_pages MCP tools are absent from this MCP build; endpoints were called directly (/v3/on_page/lighthouse/live/json with for_mobile=false, /v3/on_page/instant_pages). Full Lighthouse JSON was written to disk and parsed there."
  ],
